:"This product contains slippery elm. Slippery elm should not be taken together with any medication as it may interfere with absorption. If you have diabetes, a kidney disease, gallstones, or if you are taking any medications, consult a healthcare professional before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed recommended dose, or take longer than the recommended dose, or take longer than the recommended period, as frequent or prolonged use may result in dependence. Reduce dosage if you experience abdominal discomfort or diarrhea. If discomfort persists, discontinue use.\r\nThis product contains slippery elm. \r\nIf you notice a sudden change in bowel habits that persist over two weeks, consult a healthcare professional. Rectal bleeding or failure to move bowel after use may indicate a serous condition. If you experience any of these symptoms, discontinue use and consult your healthcare professional."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Detox Activation and Fiber Fusion Daily are safety sealed with inner seals. Do not use if seals are broken or missing. Keep tightly closed. Probiotic Pearls are safety sealed in a tamper-evident  foil pouch. Do not use if foil or plastic is punctured."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature. Avoid excessive heat and direct sunlight."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Copyright 2023 Nature's Way Brands, LLC"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Whole body cleanse\r\nComplete 10-day cleaning system"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"This statement has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Recommendation:\r\nDays Detox activation\r\nDay 1 5 tablets at night \r\nDay 2-8 5 tablets at night \r\nDay 9-10 3 tablets at nigh